  "description": "Office-style ribbon for Windows Forms, ported to .NET 10 with working out-of-process designer support. A fork of RibbonWinForms. It also builds for .NET 8. Tabs, panels, buttons, combo boxes, item groups, button lists, the orb menu, contexts and the quick access toolbar are all editable in the designer, and no design-time tooling is needed at runtime.",
  "id": "Dwain.RibbonLib",
